{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1674.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"670dbca2822969ec940b9724e299ba498ba275062715ff2a9732cbaa8065c5a8","ja":"変装の結果は……","zh":"乔装的结果是……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1674.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"a8722bb543cb2d1005eed770b7eb242f6658c1cd5b31b96fe19fccd707ab5d2b","ja":"お買い物は無事終了。\n3人は展示即売会の会場を出て、変装をといて……","zh":"购物顺利结束。\n3人离开了展销会会场，解除了伪装……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1674.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"40c18f503283dc82da27eff662772b4a450c518b48efd1a880e90d8f526ef357","ja":"変装大成功～！　なんとかバレずにすんだね。\n今日の戦果、確認しよ！","zh":"变装大成功～！总算没被识破呢。\n来看看今天的战果吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1674.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"858f456c62ae49a890fdbcab0fd5f217da103bdcad3278cfdad55dff96a8fed3","ja":"うん♪　あ、でも会場の近くだと混んでるかな？\nどこかすいてるお店に入って……。","zh":"嗯♪　啊，不过会场附近会不会很挤呢？\n找个不怎么挤的店进去……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1674.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"3b25fcd88c4413f1c5708a0241018176fa1ffb1ced352ce68f81220bedb5e350","ja":"「あの～……すみません。\n恵美ちゃん、紗代子ちゃん、茜ちゃんですよね？」","zh":"「那个～……不好意思。\n请问是惠美、纱代子和小茜对吧？」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1674.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"5def31539c23bb3f73baf1feacbfa1554c3e3108f7846f54f0c8eb286cdfbbe7","ja":"（にゃはっ！　変装をやめたらすぐ気づかれるなんて、\nやっぱり、オーラが隠し切れないんだね♪）","zh":"（喵哈哈！一卸下伪装马上就被认出来了，\n果然我的气场还是藏不住呢♪）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1674.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"9987758eb4523768506c51dbfc7e940b4f05ffdd733a0d3e390bd1aeb0da070d","ja":"もちろん！　正真正銘！\nかわいいかわいい茜ちゃんたちだよ♪","zh":"当然啦！千真万确！\n可爱的小茜们哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1674.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"73d68558c2100dbf0150936db44a06920006036cd3df66225573a94d9c4556ea","ja":"「よかった。変装やめてたから、もう話しかけても\nいいのかなって。なにか撮影してたんですよね？」","zh":"“太好了。因为你没再乔装，我还想着是不是已经可以\n跟你搭话了。刚才是在拍什么东西吧？”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1674.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"7da37ed7eb42b3148916330fd409359f8fffd0d32f2c6493bc6e5d30b8cae63b","ja":"……えっ？　ちょ、ちょっと待って。\nそれって、もしかして……。","zh":"……诶？等等，先等一下。\n那难道说……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1674.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"8e8facadc3b4166e05166b35ce115a908c0493ac8eef87a37e0ed3dbc7040cd6","ja":"えっと……みなさんも、そこの\nアクセサリー展示即売会に行ってたんですか？","zh":"那个……大家也是去了那边的\n饰品展销会吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1674.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"f18104acc2c5e270cd34371327b1efe0f5ef1da98677a704ab3b5347f77b9070","ja":"「はい！　それで気になったんですけど、\n撮影みたいだから、そっとしておこうねって」","zh":"“是的！所以虽然有点在意，\n但看样子像是在拍摄，就别去打扰了呢”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1674.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"1247d6640af30abd9ecc9153e00a08ca53178f4cf275f11aebb8bbd73f9205f9","ja":"「同じようなこと言ってる子、\nいっぱいいましたし」","zh":"“而且说了差不多话的孩子，\n也有好多呢”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1674.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"ca63af63ec89431a83ab5e315fd19dc2b9d1f8c0c3357a2b8aaea591aa6f136f","ja":"じゃ、じゃあ、最初からみんなに\nバレバレだったんだ！？","zh":"那、那么，原来从一开始\n就被大家看穿了吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1674.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"ae134f6016f793c0310027dd24d13c2124f63050b3702ba5f7dd5867d2c653dc","ja":"さっきは、みんなが気を遣って、\n知らないふりをしてくれてただけだったんだね……。","zh":"刚才其实只是大家顾及我，\n故意装作不知道而已吧……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1674.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"85aeaf0c525679af65c44d7b88cd5394cf9cc069182c137c9b0f695c14e645d6","ja":"でも仕方ないよ。茜ちゃんのカワイイオーラは、\n変装でも隠し切れないんだから。","zh":"但这也是没办法的事嘛。毕竟小茜那可爱的光芒，\n就算是乔装打扮也藏不住呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1674.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"80c2ec9d5e7e36c75df7ac955938046b534e67108ddf2a7cdfcf451420385c58","ja":"「あ、あの……なにかいけなかったでしょうか？」","zh":"「那、那个……是有哪里做得不好吗？」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1674.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"f678696c95bfab8aff77f6f499d4d01964ddb9ee5aaac35daf3207003ff0abfa","ja":"おっと、こっちの話だから気にしないでね☆\nほらほら、サインでも握手でもなんでもやっちゃうよ♪","zh":"哎呀，这是我自己的事，别放在心上哦☆\n快来快来，签名也好握手也罢，无论什么我都可以满足你哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
